{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/88c1b67029d27a126866cd0d240b66db.avif?t=1769207605\" width=512 height=129 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve a <strong> diverse cast of customers</strong>\u2014from  locals to funny tourists, and even animals like dogs or cats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based, </strong>gameplay where every ingredient and tool is simulated.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple maps</strong> such as a sunny beach, a city street, and a relaxing park.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your kiosk</strong> as your business grows: expand your cooking options, improve your setup.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grilling minigame</strong>\u2014cook food instantly for speed and profits, but risk burning it all if you mess up!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/25f58ba04a2c04e1e928ec6c82e7bacf.poster.avif?t=1769207605\" width=500 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/25f58ba04a2c04e1e928ec6c82e7bacf.webm?t=1769207605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/25f58ba04a2c04e1e928ec6c82e7bacf.mp4?t=1769207605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/c50b80d0c81f5551cdade560e1a59708.avif?t=1769207605\" width=512 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your grandpa has passed away and you inherited his beloved kiosk business to you with a letter that you can only open when you kiosk has reached a <strong>5-star status</strong>. Now it\u2019s your turn to carry on his work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your humble stand into a legendary<strong>\u00a0</strong>that would make your grandpa proud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/0a4d11a88d3a379bd63f24b32082f8f1.poster.avif?t=1769207605\" width=500 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/0a4d11a88d3a379bd63f24b32082f8f1.webm?t=1769207605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/0a4d11a88d3a379bd63f24b32082f8f1.mp4?t=1769207605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/1e2e6e0d8fd07b4906c59fca1d0f2cb6.avif?t=1769207605\" width=512 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/37bb330b89f7380e44a0180469e6e779.poster.avif?t=1769207605\" width=500 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/37bb330b89f7380e44a0180469e6e779.webm?t=1769207605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/37bb330b89f7380e44a0180469e6e779.mp4?t=1769207605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your kiosk through, physics-driven cooking:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice ingredients, grill meats, fry snacks, pour refreshing drinks and make smoothies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance speed and accuracy while serving customers during <strong>rush-time</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail the orders to earn big tips, or face disappointed customers and lost income if you slip up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the day ends, invest your hard-earned cash into upgrades:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your menu</strong> with new recipes and new equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy <strong>candy and soda</strong>\u00a0<strong>dispensers </strong> for passive income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your <strong>marketing</strong> to attract bigger, stranger, and hungrier crowds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new <strong>decorations and upgrades</strong> to make your kiosk stand out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966540?t=1769207605","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966540?t=1769207605","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/5e87e5dfc2b0eb72e7f1869b5a3b9c73593539ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769207605","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/5e87e5dfc2b0eb72e7f1869b5a3b9c73593539ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769207605","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cl