agraph\" >Your grandpa has passed away and you inherited his beloved kiosk business to you with a letter that you can only open when you kiosk has reached a <strong>5-star status</strong>. Now it\u2019s your turn to carry on his work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your humble stand into a legendary<strong>\u00a0</strong>that would make your grandpa proud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/0a4d11a88d3a379bd63f24b32082f8f1.poster.avif?t=1769207605\" width=500 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/0a4d11a88d3a379bd63f24b32082f8f1.webm?t=1769207605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/0a4d11a88d3a379bd63f24b32082f8f1.mp4?t=1769207605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/1e2e6e0d8fd07b4906c59fca1d0f2cb6.avif?t=1769207605\" width=512 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/37bb330b89f7380e44a0180469e6e779.poster.avif?t=1769207605\" width=500 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/37bb330b89f7380e44a0180469e6e779.webm?t=1769207605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/extras/37bb330b89f7380e44a0180469e6e779.mp4?t=1769207605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your kiosk through, physics-driven cooking:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice ingredients, grill meats, fry snacks, pour refreshing drinks and make smoothies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance speed and accuracy while serving customers during <strong>rush-time</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail the orders to earn big tips, or face disappointed customers and lost income if you slip up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the day ends, invest your hard-earned cash into upgrades:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your menu</strong> with new recipes and new equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy <strong>candy and soda</strong>\u00a0<strong>dispensers </strong> for passive income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your <strong>marketing</strong> to attract bigger, stranger, and hungrier crowds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new <strong>decorations and upgrades</strong> to make your kiosk stand out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["namoviot"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966540/3ae2127038b0a2fded20f6ed4f1392424d467fc7/header.jpg?t=1769207605","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966540/1719259437/4608dae5f47656304401c6da1b13d12908595a8d/1758130321/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758639342","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966540/1719259437/4608dae5f47656304401c6da1b13d12908595a8d/1758130321/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758639342","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966540/1719259437/